{
	"name": "ITSM Matrix42 → n8n Event Receiver (Template)",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Matrix42 → n8n in real time\n\nA Matrix42 **compliance rule** (e.g. *Create an Object* on incidents) starts a workflow. The workflow calls this webhook with **Http Send** and a JSON body such as\n`{\"ObjectId\": \"<item.ID>\", \"TypeId\": \"<item.CI>\", \"Event\": \"created\"}`.\n\n1. Create a **Header Auth** credential (e.g. header `X-N8N-Token`) and select it on the webhook.\n2. Send the same header from Http Send.\n3. Replace the *Your logic* node.\n\nThe webhook answers **202** immediately, so Matrix42 is not blocked; invalid calls get **400**.\nSee docs/webhook-pattern.md.",
				"height": 380,
				"width": 420
			},
			"id": "4c9f6c1e-1d1a-4d0e-9a51-0e0d4a4b0001",
			"name": "About this template",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-460,
				-160
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"httpMethod": "POST",
				"path": "matrix42/ticket-event",
				"authentication": "headerAuth",
				"responseMode": "responseNode",
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "4c9f6c1e-1d1a-4d0e-9a51-0e0d4a4b0002",
			"name": "Matrix42 Event Webhook",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
			"typeVersion": 2.2,
			"position": [
				0,
				0
			],
			"webhookId": "4c9f6c1e-1d1a-4d0e-9a51-0e0d4a4b00ff"
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"conditions": {
					"combinator": "and",
					"options": {
						"caseSensitive": true,
						"leftValue": "",
						"typeValidation": "strict",
						"version": 2
					},
					"conditions": [
						{
							"id": "has-object-id",
							"leftValue": "={{ $json.body.ObjectId }}",
							"rightValue": "",
							"operator": {
								"type": "string",
								"operation": "notEmpty",
								"singleValue": true
							}
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "4c9f6c1e-1d1a-4d0e-9a51-0e0d4a4b0003",
			"name": "Has ObjectId?",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
			"typeVersion": 2.4,
			"position": [
				220,
				0
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"respondWith": "json",
				"responseBody": "={{ { \"accepted\": true, \"objectId\": $json.body.ObjectId } }}",
				"options": {
					"responseCode": 202
				}
			},
			"id": "4c9f6c1e-1d1a-4d0e-9a51-0e0d4a4b0004",
			"name": "Respond 202 Accepted",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
			"typeVersion": 1.5,
			"position": [
				460,
				-100
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"respondWith": "json",
				"responseBody": "={{ { \"accepted\": false, \"error\": \"Body must contain ObjectId\" } }}",
				"options": {
					"responseCode": 400
				}
			},
			"id": "4c9f6c1e-1d1a-4d0e-9a51-0e0d4a4b0005",
			"name": "Respond 400 Bad Request",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
			"typeVersion": 1.5,
			"position": [
				460,
				120
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "ticket",
				"operation": "get",
				"ticketId": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "id",
					"value": "={{ $('Matrix42 Event Webhook').item.json.body.ObjectId }}"
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "4c9f6c1e-1d1a-4d0e-9a51-0e0d4a4b0006",
			"name": "Get Ticket",
			"type": "@bazulu1/n8n-nodes-matrix42-esm.matrix42Esm",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				680,
				-100
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {},
			"id": "4c9f6c1e-1d1a-4d0e-9a51-0e0d4a4b0007",
			"name": "Your logic",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				900,
				-100
			]
		}
	],
	"connections": {
		"Matrix42 Event Webhook": {
			"main": [
				[
					{
